    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "pali": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu chandasamādhippadhānasaṅkhārasamannāgataṁ iddhipādaṁ bhāveti, ",
      "english": "It’s when a mendicant develops the basis of psychic power that has immersion due to enthusiasm … "
